<title>PORTUGAL: Sonae Ind 96 net seen down as forecast.</title>
<headline>Sonae Ind 96 net seen down as forecast.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 1996 net profit of Portuguese wood products group Sonae Industria is expected to be in line with a forecast made by the company in September, its president Carlos Moreira da Silva was quoted as saying.</p>
<p>&quot;They (results) are in line with what was said in September,&quot; he told Publico newspaper in an interview.</p>
<p>Sonae Industria forecast in September that it expected to end 1996 with a net consolidated profit after minorities of 400 million escudos, compared with 1.1 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
